config FW_CS_DSP
	tristate "Cirrus Logic DSP firmware support"
	default n
	help
	  Support library for loading firmware and tunings onto Cirrus Logic
	  Halo Core and ADSP DSPs. It is selected by the in-tree codec drivers
	  that need it; enable it explicitly for out-of-tree codec drivers.
